			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Complete explicit module path migration in state and IPC\n\nContinue the refactoring from commit 10feb14ec to eliminate implicit module namespace reliance by fully qualifying internal paths:\n- Add explicit `TextProcessing` segment in DocumentStateDTO import for `AnalyzeTextLinesAndEOL`\n- Prefix ConfigurationState, UIState, and WorkspaceState type paths with their module name (e.g., `UIState::UIState::State`)\n- Update WorkspaceDelta function signatures with full `WorkspaceState::WorkspaceState::State` paths\n- Migrate AppLifecycle call site from `WindServiceHandlers::set_static_application_root` to `WindServiceHandlers::Utilities::set_static_application_root`\n\nThis ensures all internal references use the reverse-hierarchical path pattern that makes dependency relationships explicit in every call site, consistent with the CLAUDE.md module path requirements.",
			"SHA": "a7b5aff343560a506c0972c8bf1bd41d87144760"
